1. GET Addons (Pizza and Coke)
URL: GET http://localhost:8080/api/addons
2. Book Ticket with Pizza and Coke
URL: POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Body:

{
  "movieName": "Inception",
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "numberOfTickets": 2,
  "addons": [
    {
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 2
    }
  ]
}


This will book tickets for the movie "Inception" and add Pizza and Coke with the booking.


Build & Run the Application
Build the project: mvn clean install
Build the Docker image: docker-compose build
Start the containers: docker-compose up


This will start the Spring Boot application and PostgreSQL container. You can now interact with your Movie Ticket Booking system using Postman.


This should provide a fully functional Movie Ticket Booking system with added pizza and coke functionality. Let me know if you need further details!

